\@writefile{lof}{\contentsline {figure}{\numberline {12}{\ignorespaces plot both con rrc=False ($\alpha =0.5$, span=6, sps=8). Filtro RC: se observan los cruces por cero en $t = \pm 1, \pm 2, \ldots  $}}{15}{}\protected@file@percent }
